		(property "Description" "Series resistor for the D2 charge-status LED. ~1.3mA at 3.3V with the LTST-C191KGKT's ~2.0V Vf ((3.3-2.0)/1k) -- deliberately dim. This is a wearable on a small cell, and the MCP73831 STAT pin can sink up to 25mA, so the constraint here is battery life, not the driver."
